# A sample of LMHOSTS, the NetBIOS names of the computers on other networks:
# copy it to LMHOSTS and add a line for each, the address then the name
# (up to 15 characters). #PRE keeps the name in the name cache from boot,
# #DOM:domain marks a domain controller. # starts a comment.
#
# 192.168.1.10    server1         #PRE
# 192.168.1.11    pdc             #PRE #DOM:workgroup
